{"product_id":"will-you-be-there","title":"Will You Be There?","description":"\u003cp\u003eTo all appearances, Eliott’s life has been a success. At 60, he is an esteemed surgeon with a daughter he adores. The only thing missing is Ilenaa beautiful, generous-hearted girl who died 30 years ago. But when he is given an extraordinary opportunity to revisit his past, Eliott suddenly finds himself in 1970s San Francisco searching for the passionate young doctor who has yet to lose the love of his life. What ensues is a story full of intelligence, hope, and humor about making the right choices and trying to keep what we most desire.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 140 x 216\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Guillaume Musso\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780340933718\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 304\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45387098488985,"sku":"3RG9780340933718","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68231935187eb_Will_You_Be_There__Guillaume_Musso.jpg?v=1747151090","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/will-you-be-there","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}